1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"v1asaO_w70uXFnsDrASPOg","review_id":"8B3F4lPucNWlexo6r-EpZQ","date":"2017-05-09T18:48:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9391632080078125,"text_excerpt":"LOVE green to go! right around the corner from my hotel it was a haven of healthy food in a sea of southern heart attacks. the delicious oatmeal was the perfect start to my day and the fresh made daily salads gave me the energy boost i needed at lunch. you can even watch the staff making the salads so you know everything is fresh. i went here each day of my trip for lunch it was that good."},{"business_id":"v1asaO_w70uXFnsDrASPOg","review_id":"BZsZNgYZN5LeFrg1tN3d8Q","date":"2016-07-02T21:04:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9150868654251099,"text_excerpt":"I really like the salads here. They're hearty, balanced, and a reasonable price. The only thing I dislike is the confusion of the ordering system. Am I supposed to order off the menu, or should I grab and go? Are they the same items? Which direction is the line supposed to go? I'm confused every time I go, but I like the convenience and having a healthy lunch option in the area."},{"business_id":"v1asaO_w70uXFnsDrASPOg","review_id":"mi8KNS8XdF5ELiO389V1Cw","date":"2018-03-18T20:32:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9139197468757629,"text_excerpt":"I come here all the time for lunch (I work a block away) because I love the build-your-own-salad concept. The staff here is always super friendly and pretty quick on prepping the food. They do have pre-prepped salads and wraps, but I always build my own because I'm picky like that. Anyway, the ingredients are always fresh and they fill the bowl up as much as they can. They also have daily hot plate specials, though I have yet to try one, as well as a daily dessert, which I have tried and thoroughly enjoyed. They also have a frequent customer program via credit card. They're system remembers your card and after 10 visits, you get a discount. My only qualm is that I wish they tossed the sal..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"v1asaO_w70uXFnsDrASPOg","photo_id":"qQHQuqcH1moUWsHOOifMPA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qQHQuqcH1moUWsHOOifMPA.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
